<title>BELGIUM: EU rice experts to vote on aid for producers.</title>
<headline>EU rice experts to vote on aid for producers.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union cereals management committee will vote on Thursday on compensatory aid for rice producers,  an EU official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;European rice producers are due to get aid, on the same lines as cereal producers, to compensate for cuts in intervention prices,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>The issue has been on the agenda of the EU cereals and rice committee for several weeks.</p>
</text>
